  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let us assume that one of the particles is moving along the positive&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;direction and the other is moving along the positive&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;direction. The net momentum of the system is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mi>P</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mi>net</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>h</mi><mi>λ</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>λ</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mi>λ</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><msqrt><msubsup><mi>λ</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></msqrt></mfrac></math>"
  }
}